Cutting the 400-item appendix five ways

strategy              chunks   median   split a section
fixed characters         172      174           167 (97%)
fixed tokens             149      200           146 (98%)
by paragraph             200      147           199 (100%)
by structure             401       74             0 (0%)
fixed + overlap          186      200           179 (96%)

An orphaned chunk begins mid-item, so it no longer says which item it is about.
Retrieval can still find it. It just cannot tell you what it refers to.

The document with a banner on every page
  13 chunks, 13 contain the same confidentiality banner
  the banner is 11 tokens, repeated 24 times in the source
  every chunk embedded from this document carries it, so they all look alike

The table, cut at 120 tokens
  chunk 0: '# Depot capacity review (landscape page)'
  chunk 1: ',600 |     54,100 |'
  chunk 2: '74%, 51%, 69% and 88% respectively.'
  the second chunk is rows without a header. The numbers survive; the meaning
  does not.
